  "objective_summary": "Extended LeaseCoordinator with durable fenced coordination shards so exactly one fenced writer owns each mutable shard. Peers remain proposal-only: they may read snapshots, submit non-authoritative proposals, and publish immutable evidence, but cannot commit mutations. Failover advances epoch and fencing token only after the prior fence expires or is released, and every stale coordinator commit is rejected via StaleCoordinatorCommitError. Worker completion or task status alone never authorizes acceptance.",
